{"entity_id":"enemy.soldier","entity_type":"enemy","canonical_name":"Soldiers / 士兵","language":"zh","aliases":["士兵","步兵","普通士兵","Soldiers"],"description_short":"士兵是常见地面单位桶，处理时要看兵种克制、地形和是否在敌指挥范围内。","description_long":"普通士兵不一定弱；如果在指挥范围内或占好地形，贸然冲上去会亏。先用佣兵试探和包围。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"none","source_refs":["l2.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.l2.soldier.zh","language":"zh","intent":"strategy","question_patterns":["普通士兵怎么打","步兵怎么处理"],"answer":"先看它是否在敌方指挥范围内和地形上。不要让指挥官硬吃，先用佣兵试探、包围，再集中处理。","source_refs":["l2.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"none"}]}
{"entity_id":"enemy.cavalry","entity_type":"enemy","canonical_name":"Cavalry / 骑兵","language":"zh","aliases":["骑兵","骑士敌人","Cavalry"],"description_short":"骑兵威胁在于机动范围，开阔地尤其危险；防线不要被它绕到脆弱角色。","description_long":"打骑兵先看移动范围和地形。用合适佣兵挡线，别把海恩、莉亚娜这类单位暴露在可冲击范围内。","progress_gate":"start","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["l2.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.l2.cavalry.zh","language":"zh","intent":"strategy","question_patterns":["骑兵怎么打","骑兵冲过来怎么办"],"answer":"骑兵最危险的是机动范围。先看它能冲到哪里，用佣兵挡线，别让海恩、莉亚娜这类单位暴露在开阔地。","source_refs":["l2.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
{"entity_id":"enemy.flying","entity_type":"enemy","canonical_name":"Flying units / 飞兵","language":"zh","aliases":["飞兵","飞行单位","Flying units"],"description_short":"飞兵受地形限制少，容易绕线威胁后排，需要提前看移动范围。","description_long":"别只盯正面敌人。飞兵可能绕过地形打后排，部署时要给治疗和法师留保护。","progress_gate":"early_game","spoiler_level":"light","source_refs":["l2.project_notes"],"confidence":"community","answer_templates":[{"template_id":"template.l2.flying.zh","language":"zh","intent":"strategy","question_patterns":["飞兵怎么打","飞行单位绕后怎么办"],"answer":"飞兵受地形限制少，容易绕后。提前看移动范围，给治疗和法师留保护，不要只盯正面敌人。","source_refs":["l2.project_notes"],"spoiler_level":"light"}]}
